WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:15.313
It was a busy day in downtown Metro City.

2
00:00:15.313 --> 00:00:18.137
People hurried along the sidewalk.

3
00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:21.952
Cars and buses filled West Street.

4
00:00:21.952 --> 00:00:27.418
Rumble! Rumble! Suddenly the ground shook.

5
00:00:27.418 --> 00:00:30.695
"Earthquake!" a woman shouted.

6
00:00:30.695 --> 00:00:33.277
A large shadow fell over the street.

7
00:00:33.277 --> 00:00:35.702
Everyone looked up.

8
00:00:35.703 --> 00:00:42.071
A man gulped. "W-what is that?"

9
00:00:42.071 --> 00:00:44.377
Jack had a new Frisbee.

10
00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:48.491
Roxy and her friends were playing with it in Mara's backyard.

11
00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:51.419
"Hey, Mara, catch!" yelled Jack.

12
00:00:51.419 --> 00:00:53.110
He threw the Frisbee.

13
00:00:53.111 --> 00:00:56.753
Mara ran fast to catch it. "Got it!"

14
00:00:56.753 --> 00:01:00.996
"Throw it over here!" called Terrell.

15
00:01:00.996 --> 00:01:05.020
Terrell caught the Frisbee and then threw it to Roxy.

16
00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:09.157
She caught it and then threw it to Jack.

17
00:01:09.157 --> 00:01:11.998
Jack fanned himself with the Frisbee.

18
00:01:11.997 --> 00:01:15.537
"It's so hot today," he said.

19
00:01:15.537 --> 00:01:17.991
"I wish we could go swimming."

20
00:01:17.992 --> 00:01:22.040
"I asked my mom to take us to the city pool," said Mara.

21
00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:25.653
"But she has too much work to do today."

22
00:01:25.654 --> 00:01:29.761
"It's too bad we can't go to the new water park," said Terrell.

23
00:01:29.761 --> 00:01:34.390
"It's got water slides and a really cool wave machine.

24
00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:37.668
That's even better than a pool!"

25
00:01:37.668 --> 00:01:42.357
Mara shrugged. "We can't do anything about the heat," she said.

26
00:01:42.357 --> 00:01:47.609
"So let's just keep playing Frisbee.

27
00:01:47.609 --> 00:01:50.448
Here, Roxy, catch!"

28
00:01:50.449 --> 00:01:52.660
Roxy caught the Frisbee.

29
00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:56.538
Then she flung it toward Terrell.

30
00:01:56.539 --> 00:02:00.203
"Oops! Sorry about that, Terrell!" she called.

31
00:02:00.203 --> 00:02:02.276
"That was a bad throw."

32
00:02:02.277 --> 00:02:04.567
Terrell chased after the Frisbee.

33
00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:10.546
But he couldn't grab it before it sailed over the fence.

34
00:02:10.546 --> 00:02:14.281
It dropped into a neighbor's backyard.

35
00:02:14.281 --> 00:02:18.053
"My new Frisbee!" said Jack.

36
00:02:18.053 --> 00:02:20.420
"I'll get it," said Terrell.

37
00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:22.781
He climbed over the fence.

38
00:02:22.782 --> 00:02:26.550
He was back a few minutes later, carrying the Frisbee.

39
00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:29.795
Sweat dripped down his forehead.

40
00:02:29.795 --> 00:02:34.011
"Now I'm really hot," he complained.

41
00:02:34.011 --> 00:02:36.820
"I wish Rocket Girl was here.

42
00:02:36.821 --> 00:02:42.194
She could probably make it rain or even snow, to cool us off."

43
00:02:42.194 --> 00:02:47.552
Roxy grinned. "Yeah, Rocket Girl could definitely do that."

44
00:02:47.552 --> 00:02:50.958
"You think so?" Terrell looked hopeful.

45
00:02:50.958 --> 00:02:53.403
"Nope," said Roxy.

46
00:02:53.403 --> 00:02:57.548
"Rocket Girl is powerful, but she can't change the weather.

47
00:02:57.549 --> 00:03:01.590
Besides, she has more important things to do."

48
00:03:01.591 --> 00:03:06.981
"You're right, Roxy." Terrell frowned and tossed the Frisbee to Jack.

49
00:03:06.981 --> 00:03:11.024
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

50
00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:15.505
"I'll be right back," she said.

51
00:03:15.504 --> 00:03:18.282
Roxy hurried into Mara's house.

52
00:03:18.282 --> 00:03:20.932
She flipped open her watch.

53
00:03:20.933 --> 00:03:23.491
Mayor Bloom's face appeared.

54
00:03:23.491 --> 00:03:25.871
He looked very worried.

55
00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:28.392
"Mayor Bloom," said Roxy.

56
00:03:28.392 --> 00:03:30.024
"What's wrong?"

57
00:03:30.025 --> 00:03:33.268
"We need your help, Rocket Girl," said the mayor.

58
00:03:33.268 --> 00:03:36.905
"A giant monster is destroying Metro City!"

59
00:03:36.905 --> 00:03:39.560
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

60
00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:45.369
"I'm on my way!"
